{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04","cat":"bond","group":{"id":"char5064","label":"Mary: Bay Goddess"},"label":"The Antitoxin","stage":null,"prev":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_03","next":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_05","speakers":{"mary_s":"Mary","neon_s":"Neon"},"icons":{"mary_s":"si_c132_00_s","neon_s":"si_c014_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_1","text":"Commander. How are you feeling?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"LogHouseIn_d","bgArt":"loghousein_d","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_fairytalesend_if","movie":null,"shown":["mary_s"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_2","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_2","text":"Hanging in there.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_3","text":"Good.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_4","text":"We're making some progress on the antitoxin.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_5","text":"We found traces of the poison present in the sea urchins on a bird endemic to this island.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_6","text":"The bird, however, exhibits none of the symptoms you have.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_7","text":"That tells me it's developed an immunity to the poison.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_8","text":"However, I don't think this is the result of natural evolution.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_9","text":"Rather, I think it's ingested something on this island that can neutralize the toxins.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_10","text":"If we can find out what that is and have you eat some, it may help you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_11","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_11","text":"Glad to know...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_12","text":"The avian diet here consists primarily of two sources of sustenance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_13","text":"One is the fruit that grows here. There's nothing special about any of them, however.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_14","text":"Other than the fact that they're delicious.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_15","text":"The other is fish.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_16","text":"So, here's my theory.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_17","text":"Fish live in close proximity to poisonous sea urchins to scare off predators.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_18","text":"Whether or not they've developed an immunity to their poison is unknown, and also besides the point.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_19","text":"Birds, on the other hand, which eat these fish, seem to have developed immunity.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_20","text":"While hunting, these birds may occasionally be stabbed by a sea urchin, so their toxin poses a danger to them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_21","text":"We're going to take a page out of the birds' book.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_22","text":"In other words, we're going fishing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_23","text":"How tantalizingly primitive.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_24","text":"Tell me about it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_25","text":"We're going back to the past in more ways than one.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_26","text":"In the distant past, to overcome diseases, humans always had to seek treatment from nature.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_27","text":"And nature always provided the answer.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_28","text":"Nothing in this world is invincible.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_29","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_30","text":"Before humans arrived, there was no ultimate apex predator in the ecosystem.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_31","text":"Before Raptures arrived, I mean.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_32","text":"The greatest threats to humans are Raptures, and the greatest threats to Raptures are Nikkes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_33","text":"I sometimes wonder what the next stage of evolution will be.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_34","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_34","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_35","text":"Of course, this is all on the supposition that Nikkes and Raptures are considered part of nature.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_36","text":"Sorry, I went off on a tangent there.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_37","text":"It's time for me to bait my hook and try my luck at fishing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_38","text":"As for you, Commander, you stay here and rest.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_39","text":"Don't forget to press the button if you're uncomfortable.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_40","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_40","text":"By the sea.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Beach_d","bgArt":"beach_d","image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":["neon_s"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_41","text":"Watcha doin', Mary?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_breakaway","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_42","text":"I'm about to go fishing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_43","text":"No kidding!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_44","text":"I didn't know you were into fishing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_45","text":"Hehe, well I am.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_46","text":"I'm actually a bit of an amateur angler myself.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_47","text":"You are?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_48","text":"I don't want to brag,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_49","text":"but I'm kind of a big deal. I can probably catch up to 20 in one go.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_50","text":"Impressive!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_51","text":"Can I have some of the fish you've caught?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_52","text":"Oh, sorry... I cooked and ate them all already.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_53","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_54","text":"Don't worry though, I saved some for Master and you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_55","text":"It takes a bit of time to cook them, since you've gotta grill 'em over a low flame,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_56","text":"but they taste much better that way. At least, that's what I've heard.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_57","text":"... Anyway, just to confirm, do you have any fish that are still alive?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_58","text":"Oh! Are you planning on making sashimi?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_59","text":"Sort of.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_60","text":"Sorry, but I'm plumb out. As I said, I cooked 'em all up earlier.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_61","text":"Then could you teach me how to fish?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_62","text":"Sorry, no can do.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_63","text":"Why not?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_64","text":"It'd be degrading for someone of your intellectual standing!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_65","text":"You wait here and I'll get you some.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_66","text":"Thanks, Neon.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_67","text":"Is there any particular kind of fish that you want?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_68","text":"Yeah, blue with white spots on its back.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon_s","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_Mary_BayGoddess_04_69","text":"Okay, I think I've seen it a couple of times.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":nul